! Port security
!
interface GigabitEthernet0/1
 switchport mode access
 switchport port-security
 switchport port-security maximum 2
 switchport port-security mac-address sticky
 switchport port-security violation restrict

! Violation modes:
! protect  - drops unknown traffic, does NOT alert or shutdown
! restrict - drops + SNMP trap / syslog
! shutdown - err-disables the port (default)

! Authorize a specific MAC instead of sticky learning
switchport port-security mac-address 0050.7966.6801

! Enable the port again after a shutdown violation
interface GigabitEthernet0/1
 shutdown
 no shutdown

! Verify
! show port-security
! show port-security interface GigabitEthernet0/1
! show errdisable recovery
